urdfdom
------------------------------------------
URDF (U-Robot Description Format) library provides core data structures and a
simple XML parsers for populating the class data structures from an URDF file.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libconsole_bridge1.0-1.0.2-1bl3
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libtinyxml2_6-6.0.0-1
  liburdfdom-devel-6.0.2-1bl1
  liburdfdom6-6.0.2-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1
  urdfdom_headers-3.0.1-1bl1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libconsole_bridge-devel-1.0.2-1bl3
  libtinyxml2-devel-6.0.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  urdfdom_headers-3.0.1-1bl1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ros/urdfdom

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ros/urdfdom/archive/refs/tags/6.0.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack urdfdom-6.0.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./urdfdom-6.0.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/urdfdom-6.0.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/urdfdom-6.0.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liburdfdom6-6.0.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liburdfdom-devel-6.0.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(urdfdom)
  /usr/bin/check_urdf.exe
  /usr/bin/urdf_mem_test.exe
  /usr/bin/urdf_to_graphviz.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/urdfdom.README
  /usr/share/doc/urdfdom/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/urdfdom/README.md
  /usr/share/urdfdom/package.xml

(liburdfdom6)
  /usr/bin/cygurdfdom_model-6.dll
  /usr/bin/cygurdfdom_sensor-6.dll
  /usr/bin/cygurdfdom_world-6.dll

(liburdfdom-devel)
  /usr/include/urdfdom/urdf_parser/exportdecl.h
  /usr/include/urdfdom/urdf_parser/exportdecl.hpp
  /usr/include/urdfdom/urdf_parser/urdf_parser.h
  /usr/include/urdfdom/urdf_parser/urdf_parser.hpp
  /usr/lib/cmake/urdfdom/urdfdom-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/urdfdom/urdfdom-configVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/urdfdom/urdfdomExport-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/urdfdom/urdfdomExport.cmake
  /usr/lib/liburdfdom_model.dll.a
  /usr/lib/liburdfdom_sensor.dll.a
  /usr/lib/liburdfdom_world.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/urdfdom.pc

